title: Payers › Workflow Builder › Generate with FLO
route: /payers/summit?tab=builder
intro: Describe the payer's process in plain English and FLO drafts a workflow to review. No model runs behind the demo: it picks one of a few sample workflows by the words used, and says so everywhere. Anything typed as policy is kept as an unverified note, never as a rule. A person has to review and publish the result.
dir: TD
---
start s1 "Click 'Generate with FLO'\n(New menu or empty state)"
overlay o1 "Right-hand panel 'Generate with FLO'\nBanner 'Demo draft: not a live model, not payer policy'\n'Describe the payer's process in plain English'\n'Examples' (three)"
input i1 "Type a description\nor click an example to fill it in"
decision d1 "At least eight characters typed?"
click c1 "Click 'Generate a demo draft'"
process p1 "FLO is drafting (about a second, spinner on the button)"
agent a1 "FLO builds the draft from a library of sample workflows\nChosen by words: residential, iop, php, detox, concurrent or continued stay,\nreauthorization or renewal, retro, modification or extension\nDefault: initial"
screen r1 "The draft in the panel\nName with '(FLO draft)', pill 'Demo draft: not a live model, not payer policy'\n'Matched on: ...'"
screen r2 "'What FLO proposed'\n'Rules it needs that are not on file'\n'Things to set up'"
decision d2 "Did the description contain policy-like sentences?\nnumbers of days or hours, 'must', 'within'"
screen r3 "'Kept as unverified notes, not as rules'\nThe sentences, also kept on the Start step"
process p2 "Plain statement: 'A person has to review it, run it in Test Workflow and publish it.'"
click c2 "Click 'Put the draft on the canvas'"
store st1 "Workflow saved as a draft\nVersion history: 'Drafted by FLO from a description (demo draft)'"
screen s2 "The draft opens on the canvas, status 'Draft'\nChecks show anything still to fix"
click c3 "Click 'Cancel' or Escape"
endx e2 "Nothing created"
end e1 "A demo draft is on the canvas, waiting for a person"
goto g1 "Continues in: Payers › Workflow Builder › Check a workflow before publishing"

s1 --> o1 --> i1 --> d1
d1 -->|No| i1
d1 -->|Yes| c1 --> p1 --> a1 --> r1 --> r2 --> d2
d2 -->|Yes| r3 --> p2
d2 -->|No| p2
p2 --> c2 --> st1 --> s2 --> e1
o1 --> c3 --> e2
s2 --> g1
